          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 313.61,
          "end": 317.51,
          "en": "So that is the structuring and this is also something used in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 317.51,
          "end": 324.89,
          "en": "It simply allows us to access elements in objects or arrays quickly by their name or position and to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 324.89,
          "end": 325.7,
          "en": "drop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 325.7,
          "end": 327.14,
          "en": "And that does not mean delete.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 327.14,
          "end": 328.25,
          "en": "They're not getting deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
